    "source": {
      "value": "wtd4"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "### Description\nConstructed from the bones of various shapechanging creatures, shifting skeletons retain a measure of reconfigurability, allowing them to shift forms. You gain the Rearrange Bones action.\n\n**Rearrange Bones**\nActivate (1 Action)\nYou arrange your bones into the form of a Small or Medium humanoid's skeleton. This doesn't change your normal Speeds, Strikes, or senses. If you are wearing heavy clothing or impersonating a skeleton, this counts as setting up a disguise for the Impersonate use of Deception, and grants a +1 status bonus to those Deception checks."
    },
